					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680402
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680402,
					"content": "#那菈{NICKNAME}，还有派蒙！法留纳神机治好了，兰那库拉可以专心照看苗圃了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰那库拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680403,
					"content": "这是兰伽卢，兰那库拉和兰伽卢一起照料桓那兰那的苗圃。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰那库拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680404,
					"content": "这里就是兰那库拉总是提起的苗圃啊。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680405,
					"content": "是的，这里的土，原本适合生长，可以种出高兴的毗波耶。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰那库拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680406,
					"content": "还有不高兴的毗波耶？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680407,
					"content": "也不是不高兴，只是没那么高兴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰伽卢"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680408,
					"content": "…嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680409,
					"content": "就像，有适合生长的土壤，也不缺雨水和阳光，成长的过程中也没有遇到什么阻碍…好像没什么不高兴的，但是也没那么高兴。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰那库拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680410,
					"content": "哦…感觉就普普通通的。欸？那这里和其他地方不一样吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680411,
					"content": "桓那兰那的土，都很好，但是这里格外好。而且还有更重要的…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰那库拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680412,
					"content": "兰伽卢和兰那库拉，会照看它们。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰伽卢"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680413,
					"content": "照看…具体是指哪方面呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680414,
					"content": "会演奏音乐给它们听。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰那库拉"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680415,
					"content": "还会夸它们长得漂亮。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						730680416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "兰伽卢"
				},
				{
					"id": 730680416,
					"content": "这就是野生和家养的区别吗…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
